      "  -ex, --expert_mode                                 Show complete help message with expert parameters and exit.\n",
      "\n",
      "  -ndsm, --generate_ndsm                             Generate the Normalized Digital Surface Model (nDSM=DSM-DTM).\n",
      "  -max_size <value>, --max_object_size <value>       Foreground max object size (in meter).\n",
      "  -ground <mask.tif>, --ground_mask_path <mask.tif>  Path to the binary ground classification mask.\n",
      "  -anchors, --activate_ground_anchors                Activate ground anchor detection (ground pre-detection).\n",
      "  -workers <value>, --nb_max_workers <value>         Max number of CPU core to use.\n",
